      "statement": "The single-argument EmbeddingCreator.create(EmbeddingConfiguration) short-circuits the MOCK platform before resolving CacheManager.getDefaultInstance(), so the mock platform needs no cache directory; for caching platforms it delegates to the two-argument factory with the default instance, and that getDefaultInstance() call is the single call site the NoGlobalEnvironmentTest ArchUnit rule defaultCacheManagerOnlyInConvenienceOverload permits.",
