    {
      "id": "claim_6abb1a3f491443a297960e0ee316e8d9",
      "statement": "CachedEmbeddingCreator's constructor validates the environment first (so the overridden createEmbeddingModel, invoked from the super constructor before any subclass field exists, can read it via environment()), then builds an EmbeddingCacheParameter(model) and obtains its Cache<EmbeddingCacheKey> from the injected CacheManager via getCache(this, parameter), then eagerly builds the primary EmbeddingModel (required non-null) and clamps the thread count to at least 1.",
