      "id": "claim_a3a75e4677844c9d81f2a3d820011be6",
      "statement": "The embedding cache name is derived by CacheManager.getCache(origin, parameters) as the concrete creator's simple name plus the model name (with colons replaced by double underscores), so each creator/model pair persists in its own cache file inside the manager's directory; CachedEmbeddingCreatorTest asserts the file lands in the injected manager's directory.",
