    {
      "id": "claim_193d1464de6047f29a1a79ba0b4bc82a",
      "statement": "CachedEmbeddingCreator.calculateEmbeddings(List<String>) is final and dispatches: empty input returns an empty list without a model or cache interaction; threads == 1 runs sequentially with the constructor-built model; threads > 1 splits the input into contiguous chunks handled by a fixed thread pool of min(threads, contents.size()) workers, each constructing its own EmbeddingModel via createEmbeddingModel(model, params) with the last worker absorbing the remainder; futures are joined with Futures.getLogged and flattened in submission order, preserving the input order of the results.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/edu/kit/kastel/mcse/ardoco/llm/embedding/CachedEmbeddingCreator.java#L102-L139",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:d17d7779a9994c6ae54130ce082a6e92a666f9ac8b0ea836d2f63fd82ecf8c98:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/test/java/edu/kit/kastel/mcse/ardoco/llm/embedding/CachedEmbeddingCreatorTest.java#L101-L112",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:127b848b676d09923d41f54a2df210f1a384c1a0ee4bb6021ee39a66c7eb6981:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/test/java/edu/kit/kastel/mcse/ardoco/llm/embedding/CachedEmbeddingCreatorTest.java#L65-L75",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:9860289898aa58506b7dd5ec79cd97cc9df8960ffa997ddb5d1d13a4f6376f7e:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_0fe93b44593948ba9b1ef5afa966f56a",
      "statement": "Futures.getLogged resolves a worker future by logging and rethrowing InterruptedException as IllegalStateException after restoring the thread's interrupt flag, and logging and wrapping any other failure in IllegalStateException; a failed worker therefore fails the whole calculateEmbeddings call instead of yielding a silently missing vector.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/edu/kit/kastel/mcse/ardoco/llm/embedding/CachedEmbeddingCreator.java#L138-L138",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:51b6d40a7195c481d588c3af85f2e5f6dc2538fd3146facae573171f17f38384:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/edu/kit/kastel/mcse/ardoco/llm/util/Futures.java#L26-L37",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:c2734b77adfc01ae3c78f391e497c7bb96dc1f035f5f6570a6959aa29c16728b:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_83a0b48f00db443d85d7d8e6ae45e6e7",
      "statement": "Per content, calculateFinalEmbedding first consults the cache (cache.get(content, float[].class)) and returns a hit without a model call; on a miss it embeds via embeddingModel.embed(content).content().vector(), stores the vector under the content key, and returns it; failure log lines reference KeyGenerator.generateKey(content), the same content UUID the file cache stores the entry under.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/edu/kit/kastel/mcse/ardoco/llm/embedding/CachedEmbeddingCreator.java#L177-L195",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:f3682516b1e3962e05ce62d1bb90b6760c802009a2fe46f15aed8632ec8ba92f:"
        },
        {
