          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:d08bc3b168fe49e7a1b83ddd58767c935f43b5a567fe8138d6eeb5149d76a449:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_7313daa208a44783a532bbec628eaeaa",
      "statement": "CachedEmbeddingCreatorTest pins the creator contract through a recording subclass with a stubbed model: second calls hit the cache (one embed call total), results preserve input order, empty input triggers no model call, values persist across a flush-and-reload with zero further model calls, the parallel path forwards params to every per-thread model, the injected environment is visible during construction, and EmbeddingCreator.create fails fast on missing credentials while using the injected cache manager's settings (an unreachable REDIS configuration surfaces as a failure from create).",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/test/java/edu/kit/kastel/mcse/ardoco/llm/embedding/CachedEmbeddingCreatorTest.java#L53-L173",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:cebfa1b54ad9dc9ff294f63f8d168276810417c94e17c202ee8e1b7616c54f00:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_c6d7f755bfbc4346bb4fb8d24f79a952",
      "statement": "EmbeddingConfigurationTest pins the configuration API: of() sets platform and model, builder validation requires a model name except for MOCK, the environment defaults to a new SystemEnvironment, onnx() carries both file paths, fromString is case-insensitive and rejects unknown names, the MOCK creator returns zero vectors, and an ONNX configuration without file paths fails create with a NullPointerException.",
      "evidence": [
